# ── Simulation output ─────────────────────────────────────────
# A run is reproducible from its scenario plus its seed, so we
# version the inputs and never the outputs. Note we do NOT ignore
# *.csv globally — planetary data under data/ is an input and
# belongs in the repository.
runs/
telemetry/
frames/
qa_*/
qa_*.png
temporal_qa/
*.omma-replay

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
